  <Graph>
    <GraphId>5c7b3e694e314540a4bff9cb83bf3b40</GraphId>
    <Name>Raw 360 Hz force feedback signal</Name>
    <Description>For drivers who want iRacing's force feedback untouched - the full 360 Hz FFB signal with no prediction and no detail adjustment.</Description>
    <IsBuiltIn>true</IsBuiltIn>
    <Modules>
      <FFBModuleData>
        <ModuleId>SourceLFE</ModuleId>
        <ModuleType>SourceLFE</ModuleType>
        <Description>The simulator's low-frequency effects audio, turned into wheel force.  You need to enable bass shaker LFE in iRacing and use VB-CABLE for this to work.</Description>
